],"nextHypothesis":"If `sdd-new`'s manifest printed the canonical requirement/decisision acronym (NOR) and an inline pointer to the DECISION_LOG_ENTRY_FORMAT owner, then a first-Write draft would pass `sdd-check --authoring` without a corrective rewrite; test by authoring one more module-flat spec and counting Write calls before the first clean receipt."}
